menuconfig C4MTB_TELEMETRY
    bool "C4MTB privacy-preserving usage counters"
    depends on SETTINGS
    depends on ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    depends on ZMK_POINTING
    help
      Store cumulative physical-position, layer, mouse-button, and pointing
      counters on the central half. No characters, sequences, application
      names, or timestamps are recorded.

if C4MTB_TELEMETRY

config C4MTB_TELEMETRY_SAVE_INTERVAL_MINUTES
    int "Telemetry save interval in minutes"
    range 5 1440
    default 30
    help
      Minimum interval between writes to settings storage while counters are
      changing. Longer intervals reduce flash wear but increase the amount of
      data that can be lost if power is removed.

config C4MTB_TELEMETRY_EXPORT
    bool "Periodically print telemetry to the console"
    default n
    help
      Print a machine-readable snapshot every five seconds. Enable this only
      in the dedicated export firmware used on a personal computer.

endif
